UPDATE `quest_template` SET `QuestDescription`='A scout from Stormheim arrived yesterday with a significant discovery - these ancient scrolls. Within they contain a Valkyra prophecy of a new vrykul ruler - one who could turn the Tideskorn against the Legion.\n\nIt complicates matters that this vrykul may in fact be Skovald''s heir.\n\nTake the scrolls, find the heir, and bring her to the Valkyra. I think the outcasts they refer to are the vrykul of Jandvik, so that would be a good place to start.\n\n|cFF660000Specialization: Retribution Paladin|r', `VerifiedBuild`=24330 WHERE `ID`=47052; -- Retribution: Fate of the Tideskorn
